---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const seo = {
  title: "Legal Disclaimer | Investment Analytics & Data Accuracy",
  description: "Arthavi is a technology platform for portfolio analytics, not a SEBI-registered investment advisor. Read our disclaimer regarding data accuracy and liability.",
};
---
<Layout title={seo.title} description={seo.description} keywords="investment disclaimer, not SEBI registered, portfolio analytics disclaimer, financial data accuracy" schema={JSON.stringify({"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","name":"Legal Disclaimer","description":"Arthavi is a technology platform for portfolio analytics, not a SEBI-registered investment advisor.","url":"https://arthavi.com/legal"})}>

    

    <main class="container">
        <div class="page-header fade-in">
            <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
            <p class="text-muted">Last Updated: January 15, 2026</p>
        </div>

        <article class="prose fade-in delay-100">
            <h2>1. No Investment Advice</h2>
            <p>Arthavi is strictly a technology platform designed for <strong>portfolio tracking, analytics, and
                    visualization</strong>. The information, data, and calculations provided on the platform (such as
                XIRR, Net Worth, or Allocation) are for informational purposes only.</p>
            <p><strong>Arthavi is NOT a SEBI-registered Investment Advisor (RIA), Broker, or Portfolio Manager.</strong>
                Nothing on this website or within the application should be construed as financial, legal, or tax
                advice. We do not provide recommendations to buy, sell, or hold any securities (Mutual Funds or Stocks).
            </p>

            <h2>2. User Responsibility</h2>
            <p>All investment decisions are made solely by you. You acknowledge that investing in securities markets
                (NSE/BSE) involves risks, including the loss of principal. You should consult with a qualified financial
                advisor before making any investment decisions. Arthavi is not responsible for any financial losses or
                damages resulting from the use of our analytics.</p>

            <h2>3. Data Accuracy & CAS Parsing</h2>
            <p>While we strive to provide accurate data by integrating with reputable sources and parsing standard
                <strong>Consolidated Account Statement (CAS)</strong> formats:
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li>We do not guarantee the real-time accuracy, completeness, or reliability of stock prices, Mutual
                    Fund NAVs, or historical data.</li>
                <li>Parsing errors may occur when reading PDF statements from CAMS or KFintech. Users are advised to
                    verify the imported data against their official broker statements.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
            <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, Arthavi and its affiliates shall not be liable for any direct,
                indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising out of your use of the service. The service is
                provided on an "as-is" and "as-available" basis.</p>

            <h2>5. Jurisdiction</h2>
            <p>This disclaimer is governed by the laws of India. Any disputes arising in connection with this disclaimer
                shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts located in India.</p>
        </article>
    </main>

    
    

</Layout>
